# Internal service hostnames.
# api.joseph and ai.joseph currently point at the same FastAPI process
# (apps/api) since /v1/chat is served from the same gateway as /health.
# grafana.joseph points at the Pi itself, where monitoring runs.
# No reverse proxy in front of any of these yet, so URLs still need a
# port (e.g. http://api.joseph:8000/health, http://grafana.joseph:3000)
# until that's added.
192.168.1.131 api.joseph
192.168.1.131 ai.joseph
192.168.1.253 grafana.joseph
